title Login callback
' a comment line
start
:read the request;
if (pending states at capacity?) then (yes)
  :refuse the login;
  stop
elseif (state known?) then (no)
  :reply with an error;
  stop
else (known)
  :exchange the code;
endif
note right: the code is single use
while (more pages?) is (yes)
  :fetch a page;
endwhile (no)
repeat
  :retry the call;
repeat while (still failing?) is (yes)
switch (kind of token)
case (access)
  :store access;
case (refresh)
  :store refresh;
endswitch
fork
  :send email;
fork again
  :reply with an error;
end fork
partition "Cleanup" {
  -> ok;
  :close session;
}
:see other;
detach
:reply with an error;
stop
